{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15901","headline":"花 · 张南史","name":"花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花，花。\n深浅，芬葩。\n凝爲雪，错爲霞。\n莺和蝶到，苑占宫遮。\n已迷金谷路，频驻玉人车。\n芳草欲陵芳树，东家半落西家。\n愿得春风相伴去，一攀一折向天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张南史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}